[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
title = "Combat"
brief_tooltip = "[Coming Soon]
Wolves and polar bears threaten your crew.
Armed units defend against wildlife."
implemented = false
detailed_text = "[b]Combat — Coming Soon[/b]

[i]Polar bears and wolves were a constant threat to the real expedition. Weakened, starving men travelling alone across the ice were easy prey.[/i]

The arctic is not empty. Wolves hunt the weak and the isolated. Polar bears are far more dangerous still.

• Wolves target men who are alone or in poor condition
• Polar bears are extremely difficult to fight off
• Men armed with knives or hatchets will defend themselves
• Wounded survivors need rest and time to recover

Travel in groups. Keep tools distributed among your crew. A man caught alone and unarmed has little chance."
